A follow-up here: there is more information on how WAIC calculation
depends on what is monitored in help(buildMCMC) under a section called
'Calculating WAIC'.

Andrew, if you (or anyone else reading this) has any thoughts on how
we might improve the documentation (either in the manual or the help
pages)
regarding WAIC, in particular the dependence on what is monitored,
please let us know.

As a note to the development team, we might want to move a bit more of
the details from help(buildMCMC) into the manual, at least an explicit
note
about the dependence on what is monitored. We may also want to think
about emitting a message when calculateWAIC is called that gives some
indication of this.

thanks,
chris

