Ah, this time I was a little too quick.  I now see your real issue is with matrices, coming down to be vectors.  Anyway, you can easily adapt everything I said:

myData[1:numMaxRows, 1:numCols, matrixIter] ~ myCustomDistribution(..., numRows = upperRowIndex[matrixIter])

Then x is guaranteed to be a matrix, and you should use:

x[1:numRows, 1:numCols]

